This subset retains the Codex light and dark palettes, Simplified Chinese
localization, and live status and conversation metrics. Antigravity ISP manages
the daemon lifecycle and supplies the verified Stable DevToolsActivePort file.
The managed daemon connects only to that loopback endpoint. Bundled changes
limit daemon and renderer features to this subset and extend the telemetry
tooltip to count completed and cleared checkpoint rows.
Model matching treats Extra High and XHigh as equivalent effort labels.
